{
  "mark.2.p1.b1": {
    "text": "幾日かたって、イエスがまたカペナウムにお帰りになったとき、家におられるといううわさが立ったので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b2": {
    "text": "多くの人々が集まってきて、もはや戸口のあたりまでも、すきまが無いほどになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは御言を彼らに語っておられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p1.b4": {
    "text": "人々がひとりの中風の者を四人の人に運ばせて、イエスのところに連れてきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b1": {
    "text": "群衆のために近寄ることができないので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b2": {
    "text": "イエスのおられるあたりの屋根をはぎ、穴をあけて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b3": {
    "text": "中風の者を寝かせたまま、床をつりおろした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b4": {
    "text": "イエスは彼らの信仰を見て、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b5": {
    "text": "中風の者に、…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p2.b6": {
    "text": "子よ、あなたの罪はゆるされた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b1": {
    "text": "そこに幾人かの律法学者がすわっていて、心の中で論じた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b2": {
    "text": "この人は、なぜあんなことを言うのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b3": {
    "text": "それは神をけがすことだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b4": {
    "text": "神ひとりのほかに、だれが罪をゆるすことができるか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b5": {
    "text": "イエスは、彼らが内心このように論じているのを、自分の心ですぐ見ぬいて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b6": {
    "text": "なぜ、あなたがたは心の中でそんなことを論じているのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b7": {
    "text": "中風の者に、あなたの罪はゆるされた、と言うのと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p3.b8": {
    "text": "起きよ、床を取りあげて歩け、と言うのと、どちらがたやすいか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b1": {
    "text": "しかし、人の子は地上で罪をゆるす権威をもっていることが、あなたがたにわかるために",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b2": {
    "text": "中風の者にむかって、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b3": {
    "text": "あなたに命じる。起きよ、床を取りあげて家に帰れ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b4": {
    "text": "彼は起きあがり、すぐに床を取りあげて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b5": {
    "text": "みんなの前を出て行ったので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b6": {
    "text": "一同は大いに驚き、神をあがめて、…と言った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p4.b7": {
    "text": "こんな事は、まだ一度も見たことがない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b1": {
    "text": "途中で、アルパヨの子レビが収税所にすわっているのをごらんになって、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b2": {
    "text": "わたしに従ってきなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p5.b3": {
    "text": "彼は立ちあがって、イエスに従った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p6.b1": {
    "text": "彼の家で、食事の席についておられたときのことである。多くの取税人や罪人たちも、イエスや弟子たちと共にその席に着いていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p6.b2": {
    "text": "パリサイ派の律法学者たちは、イエスが罪人や取税人たちと食事を共にしておられるのを見て、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b1": {
    "text": "彼は取税人や罪人などと食事を共にするのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b2": {
    "text": "丈夫な人には医者はいらない。いるのは病人である。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p7.b3": {
    "text": "わたしがきたのは、義人を招くためではなく、罪人を招くためである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b1": {
    "text": "ヨハネの弟子とパリサイ人とは、断食をしていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b2": {
    "text": "ヨハネの弟子たちとパリサイ人の弟子たちとが断食をしているのに、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p8.b3": {
    "text": "あなたの弟子たちは、なぜ断食をしないのですか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b1": {
    "text": "婚礼の客は、花婿が一緒にいるのに、断食ができるであろうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b2": {
    "text": "しかし、花婿が奪い去られる日が来る。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p9.b3": {
    "text": "その日には断食をするであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b1": {
    "text": "だれも、真新しい布ぎれを、古い着物に縫いつけはしない。…破れがもっとひどくなる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b2": {
    "text": "まただれも、新しいぶどう酒を古い皮袋に入れはしない。…ぶどう酒も皮袋もむだになってしまう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p10.b3": {
    "text": "新しいぶどう酒は新しい皮袋に入れるべきである",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p11.b1": {
    "text": "ある安息日に、イエスは麦畑の中をとおって行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p11.b2": {
    "text": "いったい、彼らはなぜ、安息日にしてはならぬことをするのですか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b1": {
    "text": "あなたがたは、ダビデとその供の者たちとが食物がなくて飢えたとき、ダビデが何をしたか、まだ読んだことがないのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b2": {
    "text": "神の家にはいって、…供えのパンを、自分も食べ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b3": {
    "text": "また供の者たちにも与えたではないか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p12.b4": {
    "text": "祭司たちのほか食べてはならぬ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p13.b1": {
    "text": "安息日は人のためにあるもので、人が安息日のためにあるのではない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.2.p13.b2": {
    "text": "それだから、人の子は、安息日にもまた主なのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 2:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
